Acceptance Number CS-017381, Acceptance Date 2026-10-23, Application Item: Housing Assistance. The verification items are as follows:
1. The average monthly income per household is 1680 yuan, below the 2400 yuan threshold for housing assistance, and 30 points are awarded for the income category;
2. The current housing is rented, with a per capita building area of 8.6 square meters, below the 15 square meter standard. Housing will earn 25 points;
3. No self-owned property, rental contract valid and filed with completed registration, 10 points;
4. Family members living together: 4 people, including 1 student in compulsory education, 5 points added;
5. No motor vehicle or business registration record, 0 points added.
A total of 70 points. Determination rules: To apply for housing assistance, applicants must simultaneously meet the requirements of a per capita monthly income below 2,400 yuan, per capita housing area below 15 square meters, and no self-owned property; if all three conditions are met, it is not eligible; Projects that meet housing assistance conditions will be included in housing assistance; other items will not be reclassified. Hard level mapping: 0-39 points are low, 40-69 points are medium, 70-89 points are high, and 90 points and above are extremely high.
Note: DEV-1745 scanner was sent for repair in the morning. Scanned materials have been manually transferred from the window to B-54627, and this does not affect the conclusion of this case. A side note: someone suspected the issue might be "Unemployment support". Incidentally, the other side raised the possibility of "No programme applies".
